Failure Fabric

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Failure Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for explicit failure semantics, retry classification, ambiguous completion, idempotency, rollback, fencing, recovery ownership, and deterministic fault handling across distributed AI infrastructure.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Failure Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Failure Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
